 a Ready To Move project by Dimple realtors Pvt. Ltd. in Kandivali West Mumbai, offering 1,2 BHK Flats, Shop configuration. Below are the key details of Dimple 19 North.\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Dimple 19 North Price | Rs. 55.0 Lac - 2.70 Cr |\n| Property Types | 1,2 BHK Flats, Shop |\n| Dimple 19 North Status | Ready To Move |\n| Dimple 19 North Launch Date | 01 September 2020 |\n| Dimple 19 North Possession Date | 01 June 2025 |\n| Towers in Dimple 19 North | 1 |\n\nDimple 19 North in Kandivali West offers luxurious and thoughtfully designed multi-storey apartments in Mumbai, with prices ranging from Rs. 55.0 Lac - 2.70 Cr. Developed by Dimple realtors Pvt. Ltd. , the project reflects quality construction and reliability. Presently, the project is in the Ready To Move phase. It is spread over an area of 2177 Sq-m. The project offers a total of 181 units.  \n  \nThere are 1 residential towers in the project. The project was launched officially in September 2020.The exact address of this famous project is Mahatma Gandhi Road, KANDIVALI, Mumbai Suburban, MAHARASHTRA 400067.The required pincode of the project is 400067.\n\n### Dimple 19 North Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Dimple 19 North 1 BHK Flat | 330 Sq. Ft. |\n| Dimple 19 North 2 BHK Flat | 425 Sq. Ft. |\n| Dimple 19 North 2 BHK Flat | 433 Sq. Ft. |\n\nFloor plans are the perfect way to understand how the spaces/rooms of Dimple 19 North are structured and help provide a clear picture of the house layout. In Dimple 19 North the units are available in 8 configurations and 8 types of layout designs. The bathrooms are fixed with world-class fittings. Balconies are well-ventilated in all the configurations. MagicBricks lists various configurations of different residential units in Dimple 19 North.  \n  \n\n### Dimple 19 North Brochure\n\nWish to know more about Dimple 19 North? Download this comprehensive brochure to get the full details. You can easily find this brochure under