divali West locality in Mumbai.Situated in Shree Niketan, it has a prime location. Located in Kandivali West, this ready to move apartment is sold at price of ₹1.30 Cr. Available on 4 floor, this apartment covers carpet area 443 sqft. The flat features security. The pricing in Shree Niketan varies from ₹1.13 Cr - ₹2.72 Cr, offering units in 3 bhk flats configurations.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/1-BHK-615-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai&id=4d423735363738303833)\n\n![2BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Rock Avenue at Kandivali West](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"2BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Rock Avenue at Kandivali West\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West Mumbai\n\nYou can find this 2 BHK flat for sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai.It is strategically situated in Rock Avenue. You can buy this ready to move apartment in Kandivali West, at the price of ₹1.50 Cr. This property sits on 3 floor with a total carpet area of 655 sqft. The flat features reserved parking, security, service/goods lift, visitor parking. Properties in Rock Avenue are available in 1,2,3 bhk flats, priced between ₹1 Cr - ₹1.50 Cr.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-910-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai&id=4d423735363738303333)\n\n## Property Rates in 19 North\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Quarter | 19 North  (% Change in Q-o-Q) | Shreeji Aikyam  (% Change in Q-o-Q) | Atul Tower CHS  (% Change in Q-o-Q) | Kandivali West  (% Change in Q-o-Q) |\n| Apr-June'26 | ₹ 29715/ sq.ft15% | ₹ 19316/ sq.ft-11% | ₹ 21507/ sq.ft | ₹ 20774/ sq.ft2% |\n| Jan-Mar'26 | ₹ 25833/ sq.ft3% | ₹ 21742/ sq.ft-8% | ₹ 21507/ sq.ft | ₹ 20279/ sq.ft6% |\n| Oct-Dec'25 | ₹ 25006/ sq.ft11% | ₹ 23820/ sq.ft-1% | ₹ 21507/ sq.ft | ₹ 19054/ sq.ft-3% |\n| Jul-Sept'25 | ₹ 22358/ sq.ft6% | ₹ 23896/ sq.ft13% | ₹ 21507/ sq.ft | ₹ 19693/ sq.ft-6% |\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Year | 19 North  (